<title>UK: Keybank sets $500 million five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Keybank sets $500 million five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KEYBANK NATIONAL ASSOCIATION</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    02.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +6.25     PAY DATE    02.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.793    FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.793</p>
<p> LISTING    lux	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS UK/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    7.5 BP    SELL CONC  12.5 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
